				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 Indicates \lquote what\rquote  action the software component fetched from a repository (bookshelf/program/\'85) would undergo in the program/platform of interest\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\par%0D
A (As is): Used \lquote As is\rquote  . Independent of repository location. Cannot be modified.\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\par%0D
C (Configuration): \lquote As is\rquote  + Configuration\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\par%0D
M (Modified): Changes from source repository (bookshelf or program)\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\par%0D
N (New): Developed from scratch\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
